  "title": "Tentative Schedule",
  "body": " Tentative Schedule  Below is a tentative schedule for what topics will be covered when.   Week 1  Introduction and Expectations, Complex Numbers and Euler's Formula    Week 2  Sine and Cosine, Hyperbolic Sine and Cosine, Inner Products and Orthogonal Sets of Functions    Week 3  Multi-variable Functions, Polar and Spherical Coordinates    Week 4  Improper Integrals, Average\/Expectation, Approximating Integrals    Week 5  Series Representations, Taylor Series, Applications    Week 6  Partial Derivatives, Directional Derivatives, Total Derivatives, Chain Rule, Review (Midterm 1)    Week 7  Multiple Integrals    Week 8  The Jacobian, Integration in Alternate Coordinates    Week 9  Vectors, Dot and Cross Products    Week 10  Vector Spaces, Hilbert Spaces, Bases    Week 11  Matrices, Linear Systems of Equations, Reduced Row Echelon Form    Week 12  Linear Transformations, Review (Midterm 2)    Week 13  Eignevalues, Eignevectors, Eigenfunctions    Fall Recess      Week 14  ODEs, PDEs, Basic Solution Methods    Week 15  Fourier Series    Finals Week       "
